weave to_lower with s as string into string:
    return calling s.to_lower
## @deprecated Use upper instead.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `s`: the string to transform.
##
## ## Retorno
## Same as `upper`; kept only for compatibility.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## calling scrolls.to_upper with "AbC"    # "ABC"
