weave strip with s as string into string:
    return calling s.strip
## Functional form of `trim_start`: strip leading whitespace.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `s`: the string to trim.
##
## ## Retorno
## A new owned string; release it with `banish`.
##
## ## Ejemplo
